\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"high heels\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "The advertisement says there are discounts on belts, dresses, coats and shoes.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I need a new pair of jeans that fit around the waist.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "We make suggestions when deciding what to do or buy in a store. <br/>Common expressions are as follows: <span class=\"italic\"><br/>How about ...<br/>Why don't you ...<br/>I suggest ...</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "How about buying that red skirt?", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to get (something)", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to buy something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I need to get some new clothes. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le07ob09aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use when you go shopping.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "ready", "type": "name"}, {"content": "prepared to do something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I can be ready then.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le07ob09aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "advertisement", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a text, image, audio or video to help sell a product", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This advertisement is from Hamptons.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le07ob09aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "discount", "type": "name"}, {"content": "reduced price", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There are discounts on dresses, jeans, coats and shoes. "